# Source packs, unpacked in the working tree while importing. These are Konami's
# and the pack authors' work: extracted 4cc stadium packs ("<slot> - <name>/"),
# a stadiums/ folder of them, and anything unpacked beside them. Ignored so no
# amount of "git add -A" can put them in the repository - see docs/ASSETS.md.
/[0-9][0-9][0-9] - *ered/
/[0-9][0-9][0-9] - */
/stadiums/
/pes_common_extract/
/pes_lut_extract/

